      "start_seconds": 227.66,
      "end_seconds": 239.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "okay: weight 76 kilos, BMI works out to 22.7, saturation 98 percent, heart rate 69, height 183 centimetres, blood pressure 110 over 77."
